{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214960/extras/playthedemo.gif?t=1740743100\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214960/extras/newstandoff.gif?t=1740743100\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in fast paced, PvP combat where you brawl it out with your rivals in order to gain the affection of your crush! Bash your opponents away and charge up your swing to send them flying into the horizon.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214960/extras/combat.gif?t=1740743100\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New to fighting games? Not a problem! Easy to learn with space for mastery, everyone has the power to fight for their love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214960/extras/thewitches.gif?t=1740743100\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This Demo includes a Couch-Co-Op/Local version of our Cupids Cargo mode, stay within range of your crush to lead him to your enchantment garden, and bash everyone who stands in your way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214960?t=1740743100","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3214960?t=1740743100","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214960/16e535fa68024c86d40548a784fab334a0978a3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740743100","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214960/16e535fa68024c86d40548a784fab3